00&h=200&s=6a161bab570ce6d1f23322159580b4b9, https://si.imgix.net/ca3008fd/uploads/origins/bdde174f-7c1d-47fd-bdb4-eac96925edee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23513e8cac3a7e0cfe0cc7d36dcff7e4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ca3008fd/uploads/origins/bdde174f-7c1d-47fd-bdb4-eac96925edee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a88b2af64c57b09526214f7b675b81f6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。\n非常にかわいらしいホロライブの風真いろはちゃんの絵を見かけましたので、私も1枚お願いしたく。\n\nキャラクター：ホロライブ所属のVTuber「風真いろは」\nコスチューム：男物の少し大きめな白いYシャツたけを身に纏っている\nシチュエーション：彼シャツを着て「どう？」的な感じでポーズ\n\n袖が手の途中まで来ている、良く言う「萌え袖」的な感じが可愛くていいのではないでしょうか？\nまたシャツの裾の所まで見える感じ（ナマ足との境目が見える感じ）で描いて頂けると非常に嬉しいです。\n（可能ならオフィシャル絵師さんが作られているアクスタやタペストリーのように全身わかる立ち絵にしていただけると喜びもひとしおです）\n\n以上、細かい指定で面倒かもしれませんが、何卒宜しくお願いします。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/bouzumi_/status/1608070263387602945\nhttps://twitter.com/bouzumi_/status/1559842237067866112", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@10off10/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8128bea/uploads/origins/71ab5e50-a944-4b5b-9ed6-b9c81e22952b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c4ca775ec31e57b12799eb3c817b9c8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8128bea/uploads/origins/71ab5e50-a944-4b5b-9ed6-b9c81e22952b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c4ca775ec31e57b12799eb3c817b9c8, https://si.imgix.net/f8128bea/uploads/origins/71ab5e50-a944-4b5b-9ed6-b9c81e22952b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d422f80c89b972790036dbf8e902a700 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8128bea/uploads/origins/71ab5e50-a944-4b5b-9ed6-b9c81e22952b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83b6b558cf1759780a5aaa438e6143eb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Greetings once more,\n\nYour art works have always been lovely, and you have completed several for me in the past.\n\nI would like once more to commission you, to make something for a friend of mine, Lulu, of their VRC avatar. Christmas themed, maybe playing with ribbon or wrapping presents. Something cute as you always do. Outfit and pose of your choice. I look forward to what you come up with.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dTQhISSznUGnVujNJihjGForf95ue6MW?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@10off10/works/47", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/659eb082/uploads/origins/2955302b-0d40-40a0-b5ee-d0071878089f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9863f87d4350c93a573d7164a4b2cb4e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/659eb082/uploads/origins/2955302b-0d40-40a0-b5ee-d0071878089f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9863f87d4350c93a573d7164a4b2cb4e, https://si.imgix.net/659eb082/uploads/origins/2955302b-0d40-40a0-b5ee-d0071878089f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a97b2a6035baea147952b5581e1a1c3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/659eb082/uploads/origins/2955302b-0d40-40a0-b5ee-d0071878089f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=feca381fbc9005ac9f2d9078d6bb9471 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "お麩先生,\n\nNice to meet you~\n\nI would like to request an illustration of 秤アツコ (ブルアカ).\n\nPlease refer links below for some in-game CG.\nhttps://imgur.com/a/TErqCNw\n\nComposition reference:\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/78208000\n(illust by アシマ)\n\nI'll leave details to you, thank you for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@10off10/works/46", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c46632af/uploads/origins/7a027750-123c-4b83-9b33-20ffea5dd8df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s